\n\
Playing Forest gives me: Forest (untapped) + Plains (untapped) + new Forest = 3 mana: 2 green, 1 white.\n\
Playing Plains gives me: Forest (untapped) + Plains (untapped) + new Plains = 3 mana: 1 green, 2 white.\n\
\n\
