\n\
Fertilid is 3 mana, gives me a 2/2 and can fetch lands.\n\
\n\
Which is better? Balan is a bigger threat that can close games quickly. Fertilid is slower but provides land fixing.\n\
\n\
I think Balan is stronger. If I cast Balan now, I have a 3/3 double strike that can attack next turn. Opponent has a 2/1 that can't block Balan effectively (Balan would kill it and survive).\n\
\n\
Also, I have Danitha which makes equipment cheaper. Balan loves equipment.\n\
\n\
Let me cast Balan.\n\
\n\
