      "reasoning": "My turn 8. Drew Shining Armor (flash, equip to a Knight, +0/+2 vigilance). I have Danitha (Knight). That's good. I can cast Shining Armor, attach to Danitha, making her 4/6 first strike lifelink vigilance.\n\
\n\
