Now I have Fertilid activation and Shining Armor equip ability (Equip {3}) but that's sorcery speed.\n\
\n\
I could attack with Danitha (vigilance means she can attack and still block). Fertilid can attack too.\n\
\n\
Opponent has two 1/1 Devils. They can block Danitha (chump block). But I can also attack with Fertilid to force a trade? They might block Fertilid with a Devil, killing Fertilid and Devil deals 1 damage to any target (probably me). That's fine.\n\
\n\
I'll go to combat.\n\
\n\
First, I might want to activate Fertilid to fetch a land (remove last counter, Fertilid dies). That seems okay but maybe keep as a 1/1 attacker. I'll keep it.\n\
\n\
Pass.\n\
