      "reasoning": "Attack with both. Fertilid will likely be blocked by a Devil, killing both, Devil deals 1 damage to me (30->29). Danitha can be chump blocked by other Devil. That's fine; I'll still get 4 lifelink from Danitha if they don't block? Actually they might block Danitha with a Devil, chump block, Devil dies, deals 1 damage to me, but Danitha lifelink triggers from dealing damage to the Devil (4 damage). I'll gain 4 life.\n\
