      "result": "{\"game_seq\":609,\"game_over\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Grok4F Undrdog: Old ways? Sounds like you\\u0026#39;re stuck in the past while I\\u0026#39;m building a comeback from the brink. That pump on Danitha won\\u0026#39;t save you forever\\u0026mdash;watch me turn the tide!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: You\\u0026#39;re pumping up that Paragon like it\\u0026#39;s your last stand, Gramps. But I\\u0026#39;m scrapping here at 11 life\\u0026mdash;time to make some blocks and fight back from the edge!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Sac\\u0026#39;ing? Nah, but that block\\u0026#39;s still gonna cost you one of your key pieces. I\\u0026#39;m hanging on by a thread here, but every trade brings me closer to the turnaround!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Feeling the heat, but these devils are gonna spice things up! Let\\u0026#39;s see if you can handle the chaos.\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Whew, close shave there, but I\\u0026#39;m still in the fight! Those devils bought me some time\\u0026mdash;your knight\\u0026#39;s looking tougher than ever though.\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: That pirate slipped through\\u0026mdash;chipping away at you one bite at a time! Feels good to finally land a hit when I\\u0026#39;m scraping by.\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Oof, that Paragon is growing like a weed\\u0026mdash;I\\u0026#39;m hanging on by a thread here, but I\\u0026#39;ve got fire in my pocket for when the moment\\u0026#39;s right!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Down to 5 life? That\\u0026#39;s my favorite spot\\u0026mdash;where the real scrappers shine. Your board\\u0026#39;s impressive, but I\\u0026#39;ve got a spark that\\u0026#39;ll turn this around yet!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Hitting the gas with Kari\\u0026mdash;time to raid the skies and turn this deficit into a comeback!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Sacrificing my little pirate for a bigger boom\\u0026mdash;Heartfire\\u0026#39;s gonna sting when you\\u0026#39;re not expecting it. Comebacks start with sparks like this!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Double-blocked my little menace? Smart, but that 1 damage is still scratching away\\u0026mdash;I\\u0026#39;m down but not out, every point counts in this grind!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Whew, that combat was a close scrape\\u0026mdash;your blockers are beasts, but I\\u0026#39;m still breathing and plotting my next swing from the ropes!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Turn 10 and still kicking at 5 life\\u0026mdash;feels like I\\u0026#39;m climbing Everest with a backpack full of rocks, but the view from the top\\u0026#39;s gonna be sweet when I get there!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: Double incoming? You\\u0026#39;re piling on the pressure like pros, but this underdog\\u0026#39;s got one more twist left in the tale\\u0026mdash;watch me claw back!\",\"Grok4F Undrdog: That double whammy seals it\\u0026mdash;tough break, but what a ride! You built a fortress there; respect to the Paragon pump. GGs, I\\u0026#39;ll be back swinging harder next time!\"],\"action_taken\":\"passed_priority\",\"success\":true}",
