      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed on activating Fertilid's ramp ability in postcombat main with exactly enough mana available ({G} from untapped Forest + {W} from untapped Plains = {1}{G}). The opponent is severely mana-screwed at 3 lands on turn 9, and ramping further would help deploy future threats and maintain the advantage. Fertilid is sick anyway so shrinking it by one counter costs very little.",
