      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Cast Goblin Oriflamme with zero creatures on board when Zurzoth, Chaos Rider was available for the same mana cost. Zurzoth provides an immediate 2/3 body, generates devil tokens when the opponent draws on your turn, and creates card advantage when devils attack. Oriflamme does nothing without creatures and delays board development by a full turn.",
