      "description": "Declined to activate Fertilid's land-fetching ability in response to Goblin Oriflamme on the stack, despite having the mana available (untapped Forest + Plains for {1}{G}). Fertilid is summoning sick and can't attack, so using a counter now for ramp/deck thinning is likely better than preserving a 2/2 blocker versus the opponent's Oriflamme-boosted future attackers.",
