      "description": "Activating Fertilid's ability before combat shrinks it from 2/2 to 1/1, losing 1 point of attack damage when the opponent has no creatures to block. With the opponent at 14 life and no blockers, attacking first with a 2/2 Fertilid and 2/2 Danitha (4 total) is strictly better than attacking with a 1/1 Fertilid post-activation (3 total). The land fetched enters tapped and isn't needed this turn.",
